/**
 * @defgroup DspCore_BuildGuide_Dependency Dependencies
 * @ingroup DspCore_BuildGuide
 * @brief Foundation source dependency contract.
 *
 * DspCore links `Foundation::Foundation` publicly. Its pinned source baseline
 * is Foundation `0.0.1`, which brings CPSTL `0.0.1` with it.
 *
 * For a source build, `cmake/DspCoreFoundation.cmake` first reuses a
 * `Foundation::Foundation` target supplied by the parent project. Otherwise,
 * with `DSPCORE_FETCH_FOUNDATION` enabled (the default), it obtains the
 * Foundation sources at tag `v0.0.1` with `FetchContent` and builds them with
 * DspCore's toolchain.
 *
 * `FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_FOUNDATION` substitutes a local Foundation working
 * copy for the download. Set `DSPCORE_FETCH_FOUNDATION=OFF` only when the
 * parent project already provides `Foundation::Foundation`.
 *
 * An exported DspCore Release package is a separate distribution workflow.
 * Its `DspCoreConfig.cmake` uses `find_dependency(Foundation)` when a downstream
 * project consumes the package.
 */
